    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 92,
      "npc" : "Dimensional Gorge Piece",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Memorial Dungeon Orc's Memory does not exist.",
      "translation" : "獸人記憶紀念副本不存在。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 93,
      "npc" : "Dimensional Gorge Piece",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Memorial Dungeon has been destroyed by the Party Leader, or because of the time limit. Please try again after 2 hours.",
      "translation" : "紀念副本已被隊長關閉，或因時間限制而消失。請在2小時後重試。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 96,
      "npc" : "Dimensional Gorge Piece",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Only a member of the party can enter the Memorial Dungeon.",
      "translation" : "只有隊伍成員才能進入紀念副本。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 110,
      "npc" : "Mad Scientist",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "The Mad Scientist doesn't seem to notice you and keeps mumbling to himself...",
      "translation" : "瘋狂科學家似乎沒有注意到你，仍在不停地自言自語..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 114,
      "npc" : "Mad Scientist",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Mad Scientist]",
      "translation" : "[瘋狂科學家]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 115,
      "npc" : "Mad Scientist",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Haha, no Orcs are coming near me!",
      "translation" : "哈哈，獸人根本不敢靠近我！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 116,
      "npc" : "Mad Scientist",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "The power of the Dimensional Gorge is undefeatable!!",
      "translation" : "次元裂隙的力量不可戰勝！！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 118,
      "npc" : "Mad Scientist",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Orcs don't attack you?",
      "translation" : "獸人不攻擊你？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 118,
      "npc" : "Mad Scientist",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You wish!",
      "translation" : "你想得美！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 120,
      "npc" : "Mad Scientist",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Mad Scientist]",
      "translation" : "[瘋狂科學家]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 121,
      "npc" : "Mad Scientist",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Yeah, yeah.. I know it's hard to belive. I don't blame ya.",
      "translation" : "好吧好吧...我知道這很難相信。我不怪你。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 122,
      "npc" : "Mad Scientist",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I used to study the Dimensional Gorge discovered near Morocc.",
      "translation" : "我以前一直在研究夢羅克附近發現的次元裂隙。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 123,
      "npc" : "Mad Scientist",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "According to my research, the minerals found there have enormous power inside them!",
      "translation" : "根據我的研究，那裡發現的礦物蘊藏著巨大的能量！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 127,
      "npc" : "Mad Scientist",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Mad Scientist]",
      "translation" : "[瘋狂科學家]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 128,
      "npc" : "Mad Scientist",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You are a pretty distrustful person, huh?",
      "translation" : "你這人還真多疑，是吧？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 132,
      "npc" : "Mad Scientist",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Oh? Like what, travel to alternate space?",
      "translation" : "哦？比如什麼，穿越到異空間？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 133,
      "npc" : "Mad Scientist",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Mad Scientist]",
      "translation" : "[瘋狂科學家]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 134,
      "npc" : "Mad Scientist",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Very smart! I have actually just done that! See that statue over there? It's not your normal Monolith!",
      "translation" : "真聰明！我剛剛真的辦到了！看到那邊的雕像了嗎？那可不是普通的石碑！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 136,
      "npc" : "Mad Scientist",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Mad Scientist]",
      "translation" : "[瘋狂科學家]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 137,
      "npc" : "Mad Scientist",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I have created it with a combination of our technology and the unlimited energy I discovered from the Gorge! Want to try it?",
      "translation" : "我結合我們的技術和從裂隙中發現的無限能量製造了它！想試試嗎？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 139,
      "npc" : "Mad Scientist",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "...Um, that doesn't sound legal?",
      "translation" : "...嗯，這聽起來不太合法吧？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 140,
      "npc" : "Mad Scientist",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Mad Scientist]",
      "translation" : "[瘋狂科學家]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 141,
      "npc" : "Mad Scientist",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Hey, since when did something so interesting have to be legal!? How about it! You can talk to the Orcs! C'mon!",
      "translation" : "喂，這麼有趣的事什麼時候還需要合法了！？怎麼樣！你可以和獸人說話！快來！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 143,
      "npc" : "Mad Scientist",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Mad Scientist]",
      "translation" : "[瘋狂科學家]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 144,
      "npc" : "Mad Scientist",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Chances are they'll just give you lots of instructions once they see you, so just wing it! They're always saying the same thing, to the point where I memorized them!",
      "translation" : "他們一看到你，很可能就會給你一堆指示，你隨機應變就行！他們總說同樣的話，我都背下來了！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 146,
      "npc" : "Mad Scientist",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Alright... What do I do?",
      "translation" : "好吧...我要做什麼？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 146,
      "npc" : "Mad Scientist",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Umm, maybe not.",
      "translation" : "嗯...還是算了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 148,
      "npc" : "Mad Scientist",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Mad Scientist]",
      "translation" : "[瘋狂科學家]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 149,
      "npc" : "Mad Scientist",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Very good! Just sit in the hands of this statue! And try to act natural when you're in there!",
      "translation" : "很好！坐到這尊雕像的手掌上！進去之後儘量表現自然！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 153,
      "npc" : "Mad Scientist",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Mad Scientist]",
      "translation" : "[瘋狂科學家]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 154,
      "npc" : "Mad Scientist",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Oh fine, be that way!",
      "translation" : "好吧，隨你！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 158,
      "npc" : "Mad Scientist",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Mad Scientist]",
      "translation" : "[瘋狂科學家]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 159,
      "npc" : "Mad Scientist",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Hmm? Put your hand on that Monemus Statue if you want to experience traveling through dimensions!",
      "translation" : "嗯？想體驗次元旅行的話，就把手放在那尊莫涅莫斯雕像上！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 870,
      "npc" : "Kruger",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Kruger]",
      "translation" : "[克魯格]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 871,
      "npc" : "Kruger",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "*Coughing*",
      "translation" : "*咳嗽*"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 872,
      "npc" : "Kruger",
      "placeholders" : [
        "strcharinfo(0)"
      ],
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "{0}, it's you...",
      "translation" : "{0}，是你啊..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 874,
      "npc" : "Kruger",
      "placeholders" : [
        "strcharinfo(0)"
      ],
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[{0}] ",
      "translation" : "[{0}]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 875,
      "npc" : "Kruger",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Don't move! You are wounded!",
      "translation" : "別動！你受傷了！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 877,
      "npc" : "Kruger",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Kruger]",
      "translation" : "[克魯格]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 878,
      "npc" : "Kruger",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "It's... all right.. I'm dying...",
      "translation" : "我...沒事...我快死了..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 879,
      "npc" : "Kruger",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "....",
      "translation" : "..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 880,
      "npc" : "Kruger",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "The Shaman? What about the Shaman?",
      "translation" : "薩滿？薩滿怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 882,
      "npc" : "Kruger",
      "placeholders" : [
        "strcharinfo(0)"
      ],
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[{0}] ",
      "translation" : "[{0}]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 883,
      "npc" : "Kruger",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "The Shaman's dead now. Who was that Shaman really?",
      "translation" : "薩滿已經死了。那薩滿到底是什麼人？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 885,
      "npc" : "Kruger",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Kruger seemed to be relieved as he hears of the death of the Shaman, but you notice the bitter expression on his face.",
      "translation" : "克魯格聽到薩滿死訊後似乎鬆了口氣，但你注意到他的臉上仍帶著苦澀。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 887,
      "npc" : "Kruger",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Kruger]",
      "translation" : "[克魯格]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 888,
      "npc" : "Kruger",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I.. I just couldn't kill my own daughter...",
      "translation" : "我...我就是下不了手殺自己的女兒..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 889,
      "npc" : "Kruger",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Thank you, I'm sure she's finally free from the nightmare that used to choke her soul.",
      "translation" : "謝謝你，我相信她終於擺脫了曾經扼住她靈魂的噩夢。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 891,
      "npc" : "Kruger",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Kruger was about to say something more, but he breathed his last breath before he could...",
      "translation" : "克魯格似乎還想說些什麼，但話未出口便嚥下了最後一口氣..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 896,
      "npc" : "Kruger",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You can see the dead body of Kruger, peacefully lying on the ground.",
      "translation" : "你看見克魯格的遺體安詳地躺在地上。"
    }
  ]
}